  "description": "Validated, strongly-typed objects out of any LLM. Wraps any Microsoft.Extensions.AI IChatClient, generates a JSON schema from your POCO, validates the result, and retries by feeding the exact validation errors back to the model. Supports streaming partial objects, streaming iterables, token budgets, and runs on .NET Framework 4.6.2+ through .NET 10.",
